          "@id": "edam:topic_0080"
        }
      ],
      "sc:author": "Fishka Bio",
      "sc:description": "Browser-based tool to open almost any sequence file — FASTA, FASTQ, GenBank, EMBL, Swiss-Prot, AB1/ABIF, SCF, Clustal, Stockholm, PHYLIP, NEXUS, MSF, PIR and more — see every sequence inside, pick the ones you want, and save them as FASTA. The format is detected from the file content, not from the extension, so unlabelled or misnamed files still open. Runs entirely in the browser — files are never uploaded.",
      "sc:featureList": [
        {
          "@id": "edam:operation_0233"
        },
        {
          "@id": "edam:operation_2121"
        }
      ],
